#. 死体の身元を知る為の<CLT 3>手掛かり<CLT>なら、
#. ちゃんと残されてたよ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There was <CLT 3>one clue<CLT> left behind that we can use to\n"
"identify the body."
msgstr ""

#. え！？　ホントに！？
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What? For real!?"
msgstr ""

#. ウソだったら…
#. あ、あんた…珍しい死に方するわよ…
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"If you're l-lying, you'll die a cruel and unusual\n"
"d-death...!"
msgstr ""

#. 珍しい死に方？　なんか気になんべ！
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "A cruel and unusual death!? This I gotta see!"
msgstr ""

#. なんないよ！
#. 苗木、無視して話して！
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"She's just being stupid! Ignore them, Makoto. Tell us\n"
"what you're talking about!"
msgstr ""

#. 死体の身元を知る為の手掛かりは…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The key to figuring out who it was..."
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の<CLT 3>手の甲にあったタトゥー<CLT>だよ。
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...is the <CLT 3>tattoo on the back of her hand<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. なんだか変わった<CLT 3>デザイン<CLT>だけど…
#. これって、犬…？
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah. The <CLT 3>design's<CLT> pretty strange, huh? Is\n"
"this...a dog?"
msgstr ""

#. ご、ご主人様に彫らされたのね…
#. あたしは…あなたのメス犬ですって意味で…
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Her master m-must have made her get it...to be like,\n"
"\"You're my b-bitch.\""
msgstr ""

#. そんな屈辱的な意味が隠されてたんか！？
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Seriously!? They really did something that\n"
"humiliating!?"
msgstr ""

#. そうじゃない。そのタトゥーには
#. <CLT 3>“被害者の正体”<CLT>が隠されているんだ。
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"No, that's not it. The <CLT 3>identity of the victim<CLT> is\n"
"hidden within that tattoo."
msgstr ""

#. えっ！？　そのタトゥーに！？
msgctxt "0012 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Whoa, really!?"
msgstr ""

#. え？　何言ってるの？
msgctxt "0013 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr ""

#. だから、そのタトゥーが
#. どう被害者の正体と繋がるのかって話でしょ？
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You were trying to explain how the tattoo is connected\n"
"to the victim's identity, right?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、うん…
#. そうだったよね…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, yeah...that's right."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. それは…
#. 被害者の正体とは関係ないんじゃない？
msgctxt "0017 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That doesn't have anything to do with the victim's\n"
"identity, does it...?"
msgstr ""

#. そうね…
#. もう少しよく考えてみるべきじゃないかしら？
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"She's right. Perhaps you should think about this a\n"
"little harder..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. やっぱり、そ、そうなんでしょ…？
#. ご主人様に彫らされたんだわ…！
msgctxt "0020 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I was r-right, wasn't I? Her master made her g-get it!"
msgstr ""

#. 違うと言ってる…
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You're absolutely wrong."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木、お前はわかっているはずだ…
#. さっさと答えろ…
msgctxt "0022 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I know you know this, Makoto. Hurry up and explain it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>そうだ…この<CLT><CLT 3>タトゥー<CLT><CLT 4>と<CLT><CLT 3>ある情報<CLT><CLT 4>を照らし合わせれば、
#. 被害者の正体が判明するはずなんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If you compare the <CLT><CLT 3>tattoo<CLT><CLT 4> to <CLT><CLT 3>other information<CLT><CLT 4> we\n"
"have, the victim's identity should become clear...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>傭兵部隊フェンリル<CLT>…
#. 戦刃むくろが所属してた傭兵部隊の名前だよ…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The <CLT 3>Fenrir Mercenary Corps<CLT>. That's the name of the\n"
"military group Mukuro Ikusaba belonged to..."
msgstr ""

#. それが、どうしたんだべ？
msgctxt "0026 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Okay, so...?"
msgstr ""

#. フェンリルに所属する兵士達は、
#. 自分が組織の一員である事を示す為に…
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"To show that they're a member of the team, each\n"
"soldier that joins the squad..."
msgstr ""

#. 必ず、体のどこかに、
#. <CLT 3>フェンリルを表す刻印<CLT>を刻んでいるらしい。
msgctxt "0028 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...would get a <CLT 3>tattoo representing Fenrir<CLT> somewhere\n"
"on their body."
msgstr ""

#. フェンリルを表す刻印…？
msgctxt "0029 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Fenrir...?"
msgstr ""
